<title>UK: TABLE - MEPC H1 pre-exceps pretax up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - MEPC H1 pre-exceps pretax up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.5	     vs 11.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.25	     vs 5.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     75.7	     vs 67.0</p>
<p> Gross rental income    192.2	    vs 193.3</p>
<p> Net income from props  130.7	    vs 131.3</p>
<p> Assets		     3,342.1	  vs 3,632.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British real estate group is MEPC Plc.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pretax profits between 64 million and 67 million stg and an unchanged 5.25p/shr dividend. The figures exclude a 73.2 million stg provision for interest rate swap terminations.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
